{"id": "De9EZjEDCNP", "title": "Video by jayantcreates.ai", "description": "How to go from 0 to 31K followers with Claude, without guessing what to post 🔥\n\nStep 1: Build your AI brain. Connect Ootto to Claude once. It reads your website and your last reels and learns your niche, offer, audience, voice and story before it writes a single word.\n\nStep 2: Ootto builds a watch list of the top creators in your niche and ranks their reels by outlier score. Study only the 5x+ outliers. They're proven ideas.\n\nStep 3: Build your outlier matrix. Ootto finds your 5 subtopics and the 6 formats that go viral the most. 5 x 6 = 30 ideas backed by data.\n\nStep 4: Post 2x a day for 15 days. Ootto ranks all 30, finds the 1-2 that won, and for the next 15 days you post only those, each with a new hook.\n\nComment MATRIX and I'll send you the exact Claude prompt that audits your account and plans your reels for you. Save this for your next 30 days.\n\n#claudeai #instagramgrowth #contentstrategy #reelstips #aitools", "channel": "jayantcreates.ai", "uploader_id": "26307178818", "uploader": "Jayant", "timestamp": 1793010562, "like_count": 3015, "comment_count": 2506, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18125924260874819a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.794, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPhIlk4wrWIJX6JFBIqQeHS5c-6AH_05zAzGjHf2Sy-Bgvk27ussaMhDfm5rbyLrAz9F6ZGy6BMY6xOwwx2Q0gz4WAx0QrJXIMscA4.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=lEd7dShgFn4Q7kNvwG5JcmH&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=m7nMRyaT7zDBXJTgIS0nFg&_nc_ss=7a580&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRt36-zhlxBoqTJycloARpqKHHtzfYVglURmYvfV4wklA&oe=6B03BEE3", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 72.794, "resoluti